WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.422
To order parts from a vendor, click the order's PO number on Orders.

00:00:10.855 --> 00:00:12.190
Then click Place order.

00:00:14.524 --> 00:00:18.402
Tick the vendor, type the quantity, then click Generate PO.

00:00:22.428 --> 00:00:28.361
Then download or print the PO, copy the email text for the vendor, and tick Order placed once they have it.
